---
---

<section id="outro" class="outro" data-section="outro" data-room="06 / 06">
  <div class="outro__top">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="ix">06</span>FIN DE LA TRANSMISIÓN</div>
      <h2 class="reveal">Seguí scrolleando.<br />La <span class="strike">cortina</span> ya está cayendo.</h2>
      <p class="reveal">Confirme su salida. El sistema cerrará el expediente al alcanzar el cien por ciento.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<aside class="curtain" id="curtain" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="curtain__top">
    <span>EXP_0421/47 · SECTOR_07</span>
    <span class="stamp">EXPEDIENTE CERRADO</span>
  </div>
  <h2 class="curtain__big">
    Un <span>archivo</span><br />
    que no debió<br />existir.
  </h2>
  <div class="curtain__bot">
    <span>14:23:08 UTC · 2047</span>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#hero">↑ Reabrir expediente</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://gsap.com/docs/v3/Plugins/ScrollTrigger/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ScrollTrigger</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://lenis.darkroom.engineering/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Lenis</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
  .outro {
    position: relative;
    height: 220vh;
    padding: 0;
    background: var(--c-ink);
    color: var(--c-bone);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(232, 226, 211, 0.08);
  }
  .outro__top {
    height: 100vh;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding-inline: var(--space-l);
  }
  .outro__top h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--text-4xl);
    line-height: 0.96;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    max-width: 18ch;
  }
  .outro__top h2 .strike { position: relative; }
  .outro__top h2 .strike::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: -4%; right: -4%;
    top: 50%;
    height: 0.14em;
    background: var(--c-amber);
  }
  .outro__top p {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--c-bone-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-m);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  /* ----- Curtain — fixed overlay that rises into view ----- */
  .curtain {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background: var(--c-bone);
    color: var(--c-ink);
    z-index: 30;
    transform: translateY(100%);
    will-change: transform;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
    padding: var(--space-l);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .curtain.active { pointer-events: auto; }

  .curtain__top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--c-ink);
  }
  .curtain__top .stamp { color: var(--c-blood); }

  .curtain__big {
    align-self: center;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(72px, 12vw + 16px, 220px);
    line-height: 0.88;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    max-width: 14ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .curtain__big span { font-style: normal; color: var(--c-blood); }

  .curtain__bot {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--c-bone-3);
    gap: var(--space-l);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .curtain__bot ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0; margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-m);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .curtain__bot a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--c-ink);
    transition: color var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out-quart);
  }
  .curtain__bot a:hover { color: var(--c-amber); }
</style>
